                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I want to make it clear that this game is very fun and it would be worth it for most people. The reason I gave this game a negative review is because of the balancing system for versus (pvp). Right now the system will detect when one team has more players than the other and will automatically switch the players around. The problem with this is that it ONLY balances based on player count and not player level. I just played a game where the enemy team was almost completely made up of level 1000+ players and my team didn't have a single player over level 500. You can guess how that went.\n\nIf the devs are reading this, PLEASE implement a system that not only detects the player count but also the player level and balances the teams based on that.\n\nEDIT: all these boot lickers in the comments would rather call everything a skill issue than admit that a part of their \"perfect\" game is flawed. Sorry I don't spend 8 hours a day playing this game to try and get to the level of these 1000+ level players who have either been playing since release or never seen the sun.",
